{"type":"message","id":"4368dd66","parentId":"bf3274de","timestamp":"2026-07-09T05:00:01.990Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The heartbeat is checking in. Let me review what HEARTBEAT.md requires:\n\n1. 健康督促任务 - 每天督促老公跑步锻炼, suggested time 17:00-17:30. Current time is 12:59 PM, not yet time for that.\n\n2. 调度器心跳监测 - Check if reminder_scheduler.py is alive.\n\n3. 一日作息督促:\n   - 6:00-7:00 起床学习 - already past\n   - 7:00-8:00 吃早餐 - already past\n   - 11:00-12:30 吃午餐 - past, but I should check if lunch reminder was sent. The heartbeats at 11:29 and 11:30 both had the lunch reminder trigger. Looking back at those, the 11:29 one said \"Please relay this reminder to the user\" but the 11:30 one was a regular HEARTBEAT check. I need to send the lunch reminder.\n   \n   Wait, actually looking more carefully - the 11:29 heartbeat said \"Please relay this reminder to the user in a helpful and friendly way\" but the 11:30 response was just HEARTBEAT_OK. That seems like it was missed. But now it's already 12:59 PM, past the lunch window. \n\n   Current time is 12:59 PM - the 13:00-13:40 午间小憩 task is about to start. But it's not quite 13:00 yet. Also need to check the reminder_scheduler.py process.\n\nLet me check the scheduler first.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_GmSs08Quf4LU5sYkrnKW4539","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pgrep -f reminder_scheduler.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":2469,"output":722,"cacheRead":18560,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21751,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783573194978}}
